  Description: 'Shelves - intensity 3 of Shatterplane: five stacks of three parallel plates 70 u apart
    - a square ring peels the front one and the guns eat it from the face - five crystals on
    their axes. 6615 prisms, all neutral (6615 breakable, 0 super-shielded, 0 danger).
    Membrane radius 1200, spawn ring 780, the standard nucleus resized to 470 u by the
    controller (the ring blast is as wide as the nucleus; play geometry, not a claim), the
    crystal field laid by the controller on the plates'' axes (Space crystals, one per team
    present at every site, each collectable by its team alone). No flora; no fauna. Authored
    by Tools/Build/author_shatterplane_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
